      "body": "Third quarter 2026 results: EPS: ₹2.13 (down from ₹3.27 in 3Q 2025). Revenue: ₹281.4m (down 31% from 3Q 2025). Net income: ₹14.4m (down 35% from 3Q 2025). Profit margin: 5.1% (down from 5.4% in 3Q 2025). The decrease in margin was driven by lower revenue. Over the last 3 years on average, earnings per share has fallen by 2% per year but the company’s share price has fallen by 8% per year, which means it is performing significantly worse than earnings.",
